{"1714400": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Neo Art Space", "steam_appid": 1714400, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Neo Art Space is a cinematic journey through a galaxy of light art.<br>No gameplay. No stress. Just experience.</strong></h2><br>Neo Art Space is a premier art entertainment experience in virtual reality—a cosmic journey through dazzling light art—designed to evoke relaxation, joy, and awe. Journey into a luminous galaxy where you become an explorer of planets, stars, and a radiant array of light art. Discover more than 30 immersive environments, orchestrated with ethereal music that transforms perception and invites you into a universe of color, motion, and wonder.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1714400/extras/beda8aef6b8372c0a1845df8b8302c4d.poster.avif?t=1778477396\" width=606 height=316 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1714400/extras/beda8aef6b8372c0a1845df8b8302c4d.webm?t=1778477396\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1714400/extras/beda8aef6b8372c0a1845df8b8302c4d.mp4?t=1778477396\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Begin with the <strong>13-minute Lightship Ride,</strong> a fully guided experience that carries you through the highlights of this luminous universe—easy for anyone to use. <strong>Or explore freely</strong> using controllers across more than 30 immersive environments, moving at your own pace through this galaxy of mesmerizing light art. Teleport, glide, jump through portals, and follow pathways into glowing caves, vibrant forests, geometric forms, and vast cosmic observatories. Each environment unfolds as a living work of art. Watch for interactive elements you activate through touch.<br><br><strong>No gameplay. No stress. Just experience.</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1714400/extras/68a621fb4f758fa57f23c28e58ca8e15.poster.avif?t=1778477396\" width=300 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1714400/extras/68a621fb4f758fa57f23c28e58ca8e15.webm?t=1778477396\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1714400/extras/68a621fb4f758fa57f23c28e58ca8e15.mp4?t=1778477396\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Experience Neo Art Space solo or with others. Join friends in private sessions or explore alongside others in shared spaces—creating moments of awe and discovery in a universe designed to be both expansive and deeply immersive.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1714400/extras/681611fdd399a894a4f57ec7e7dac50b.poster.avif?t=1778477396\" width=300 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1714400/extras/681611fdd399a894a4f57ec7e7dac50b.webm?t=1778477396\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1714400/extras/681611fdd399a894a4f57ec7e7dac50b.mp4?t=1778477396\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Neo Art Space is a cinematic journey through a galaxy of light art.<br>No gameplay. No stress. Just experience.</strong></h2><br>Neo Art Space is a premier art entertainment experience in virtual reality—a cosmic journey through dazzling light art—designed to evoke relaxation, joy, and awe. Journey into a luminous galaxy where you become an explorer of planets, stars, and a radiant array of light art. Discover more than 30 immersive environments, orchestrated with ethereal music that transforms perception and invites you into a universe of color, motion, and wonder.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1714400/extras/beda8aef6b8372c0a1845df8b8302c4d.poster.avif?t=1778477396\" width=606 height=316 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1714400/extras/beda8aef6b8372c0a1845df8b8302c4d.webm?t=1778477396\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1714400/extras/beda8aef6b8372c0a1845df8b8302c4d.mp4?t=1778477396\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Begin with the <strong>13-minute Lightship Ride,</strong> a fully guided experience that carries you through the highlights of this luminous universe—easy for anyone to use. <strong>Or explore freely</strong> using controllers across more than 30 immersive environments, moving at your own pace through this galaxy of mesmerizing light art. Teleport, glide, jump through portals, and follow pathways into glowing caves, vibrant forests, geometric forms, and vast cosmic observatories. Each environment unfolds as a living work of art. Watch for interactive elements you activate through touch.<br><br><strong>No gameplay. No stress. Just experience.</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1714400/extras/68a621fb4f758fa57f23c28e58ca8e15.poster.avif?t=1778477396\" width=300 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1714400/extras/68a621fb4f758fa57f23c28e58ca8e15.webm?t=1778477396\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1714400/extras/68a621fb4f758fa57f23c28e58ca8e15.mp4?t=1778477396\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Experience Neo Art Space solo or with others. Join friends in private sessions or explore alongside others in shared spaces—creating moments of awe and discovery in a universe designed to be both expansive and deeply immersive.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1714400/extras/681611fdd399a894a4f57ec7e7dac50b.poster.avif?t=1778477396\" width=300 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1714400/extras/681611fdd399a894a4f57ec7e7dac50b.webm?t=1778477396\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1714400/extras/681611fdd399a894a4f57ec7e7dac50b.mp4?t=1778477396\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>", "short_description": "This is not a game. Neo Art Space is a cinematic VR journey through a galaxy of light art—an immersive experience of awe, joy, and wonder. Ride the Lightship or explore 30+ worlds—teleport, fly, and discover animated art encounters—solo or with friends.", "supported_languages": "English", "reviews": "“Through his Neo Art Space VR experience, Noyed constructs immersive and interactive environments that engage the viewer in entirely new ways. Using Unity technology, he creates virtual spaces where users can interact with and manipulate the artwork, evoking sensations of wonder and delight.”<br>ArtJourney<br><br>“NEO ART SPACE is a wow-inspiring immersive Virtual Reality (VR) art experience. Traveling through space and time, you emerge in a new universe as an explorer of planets, stars, galaxies, and dazzling moving colorful light art.”<br>ArtTour International<br><br>“Neo Art Space, marks a significant milestone in his career. This immersive VR experience is a cosmic odyssey, offering viewers over 30 light art experiences in a virtual galaxy, a testament to his innovative approach to art.”<br>Aatonau<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1714400/11f98c5353fd0fd47e492eced35b8d2ff1cf4144/header.jpg?t=1778477396", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1714400/8c22b89c92fd1478794090feb75382a801d4572c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1778477396", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1714400/8c22b89c92fd1478794090feb75382a801d4572c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1778477396", "website": "http://www.NeoArtSpace.com", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Quad Core+<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1060 / AMD Radeon RX 480 or greater<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Any<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> OpenXR on Meta Quest 2+</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "legal_notice": "© 2025 Neo Art Lab, LLC. All Rights Reserved.", "developers": ["Neo Art Lab"], "publishers": ["Neo Art Lab"], "demos": [{"appid": 1743630, "description": ""}], "price_overview": {"currency": "USD", "initial": 1999, "final": 1999, "discount_percent": 0, "initial_formatted": "", "final_formatted": "$19.99"}, "pa